'''Pikachu, Smiling and Fast Asleep''' (Chinese: '''微笑沉睡比卡超''' ''Mèihsiu Chàhmseuih Béikāchīu'') is an ending theme of the Cantonese dub of {{aniseries|PTS}}. Despite being made, it has never been used in the dub.

It is an adaptation of {{wp|Kelly Chen}}'s song "Smiling and Fast Asleep" (Chinese: '''微笑沉睡''' ''Mèihsiu Chàhmseuih'').

